## Detected Conventions

Conventions observed in this codebase (from config and the import graph). Follow them unless project-authored rules say otherwise:

- Use the configured tsconfig path alias(es) \`@/*\` for internal imports - do not replace them with deep relative paths.
- Feature-first layout: each \`features/<feature>/\` folder owns \`types.ts\`, \`constants.ts\`, feature hooks (\`hooks/\` or \`use*.ts\`), a feature-local \`api/\` layer - add new feature code inside its feature folder, not in shared dirs.
